chool in Eufaula, Alabama. He was selected to the 2023 All-American Bowl. A five-star recruit, he committed to the University of Alabama to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"After redshirting his first year at Alabama in 2023, Pierre played in 11 games his freshman year in 2024 and had six tackles. As a redshirt sophomore in 2025, he became a starter after numerous injuries and recorded three sacks against the 2025 Tennessee Volunteers."}]}}